function enrichPlayer(side,player){const id=String(player?.id||player?._id||player?.playerId||'');const name=cleanPlayerName(playerLabel(player));const profile=teamRosterFor(side).find(item=>String(item?.id||item?._id||item?.playerId||'')===id||cleanPlayerName(item?.name||item?.playerName||'')===name)||{};return {...profile,...player}}
